  /// Single legacy approver. Kept for back-compat with rows seeded before
  /// `approverUserIds` existed. New writes should populate the array; the
  /// resolver reads `approverUserIds` first and falls back to this field
  /// when the array is empty so old data keeps working untouched.
  approverUserId       String?
  /// Pool of users eligible to act on this step. Any one of them can
  /// approve (whichever clicks first), with the requester auto-excluded
  /// at resolve time. Empty array means "fall back to approverUserId / role".
  approverUserIds      String[]
  approverDepartmentId String?
  amountThresholdMin   Decimal? @db.Decimal(18, 2)
